[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, it is essential to carry out the following preliminary operations:\n(1) turn the ignition off and remove the key;  (2) disconnect the\nbattery terminals and insulate them; (3) wait at least 10 minutes\nbefore proceeding.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (see assembly 5508C - AIR BAG SYSTEM).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing the steering wheel,\nposition the wheels as parallel as possible to the longitudinal\naxis of the vehicle.</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p>Remove the complete glove compartment as\ndescribed in the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753179\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753359\">7210E36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Remove the instrument panel supporting\ncrossmember complete with heater/air conditioner and dashboard wiring\nas described in the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753193\">7040A98</a></p><p>(Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753223\">7045A13</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753217\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753265\">7050A19</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753216\">7040L10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752916\">5050B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753356\">7210E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753141\">7025A64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752829\">4450B12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752927\">5505A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752938\">5505C27</a></p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/2752938\">5505C27</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752927\">5505A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752829\">4450B12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753141\">7025A64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753356\">7210E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752916\">5050B34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753216\">7040L10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753265\">7050A19</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753217\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753223\">7045A13</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a></p><p>(Both)</p><p>Fit the instrument panel supporting crossmember complete\nwith heater/air conditioner and dashboard wiring as described in\nthe procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753193\">7040A98</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753359\">7210E36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753179\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Fit the complete glove compartment as indicated\nin the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><p>If the car is fitted with air conditioner,\ncarry out the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752379\">0010T21</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p>Check the operation of the Air Bag system\nand all the devices concerned using the Examiner or other diagnostic\ninstruments.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]